# On the desk: Settings > Cloud agents > Add agent saves agentd-NAME.mjs. Copy it here, then start the service:
#   sudo install -o root -g agenticops-agent -m 0640 agentd-NAME.mjs /etc/agenticops-agent/agentd.mjs
#   sudo systemctl enable --now agenticops-agent
# The agent needs no open port: it reads jobs from the desk's job channel repository with git. The agenticops-agent
# user's git must be able to push there (an SSH deploy key or a credential helper in its home folder).
